  ('cmvv8p7x3000rtq9wlhv3m1cu','axe-dark-temptation','AXE Dark Temptation',NULL,'axe dark temptation ','AXE Dark Temptation is a bold men’s fragrance and body-care range known for its warm, irresistible scent inspired by chocolate and rich spices. Its smooth, masculine aroma combines sweet and spicy notes to create a distinctive fragrance that keeps you feeling fresh and confident.',NULL,'1 pc',231,NULL,'/media/optimized/agaseke-axe-dark-temptation.webp',false,3,'cmvv8p4ka0000tq9wg6zkjl7q',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pcle0049tq9wvlt8roi6','axe-essence-black-pepper-cedarwood','AXE Essence Black Pepper & Cedarwood',NULL,'axe essence black pepper & cedarwood ','AXE Essence Black Pepper & Cedarwood delivers a bold, masculine fragrance combining the spicy warmth of black pepper with the rich, woody character of cedarwood. The result is a confident and sophisticated scent that feels fresh, modern and distinctive.',NULL,'1 pc',769,NULL,'/media/optimized/agaseke-axe-essence-black-pepper-cedarwood.webp',false,3,'cmvv8p4ka0000tq9wg6zkjl7q',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pb2g003dtq9wue1r3zq3','absolut-vodka','Absolut Vodka',NULL,'absolut vodka ','Absolut Vodka is a premium Swedish vodka known for its smooth, clean and full-bodied character. Crafted from high-quality ingredients, it offers a rich yet balanced taste with subtle grain notes and a smooth finish.',NULL,'1 pc',3077,NULL,'/media/optimized/agaseke-absolut-vodka.webp',false,5,'cmvv8p4l40002tq9w6igk17c7',NULL),
  ('cmvv8p9rp002dtq9wsmia0ajt','adidas-6in1','Adidas 6in1',NULL,'adidas 6in1 ','Adidas 6 in 1 is a versatile men’s body-care product designed to provide effective cleansing and everyday freshness. Its multi-benefit formula helps cleanse the body, face and hair, making it a convenient all-in-one option for an active lifestyle.',NULL,'1 pc',462,NULL,'/media/optimized/agaseke-adidas-6in1.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p4ka0000tq9wg6zkjl7q',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pcwx004ptq9wl6rdg41h','alo-body-lotion-or-men','Alo Body Lotion or Men',NULL,'alo body lotion or men ','Give your skin the everyday care it deserves with Alo Body Lotion for Men. Designed for daily use, this moisturizing lotion helps keep the skin feeling soft, smooth, and comfortable while leaving behind a fresh, masculine scent. Its easy-to-use formula makes it a great addition to your routine after showering or whenever your skin needs extra moisture.',NULL,'1 pc',192,NULL,'/media/optimized/agaseke-alo-body-lotion-or-men.webp',false,5,'cmvv8p4kr0001tq9w6f7gbftg',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pd1y005dtq9wexs38ih5','alo-deodorant','Alo Deodorant',NULL,'alo deodorant ','Stay fresh, confident, and comfortable throughout your day with Alo Deodorant. Designed for everyday freshness, it helps keep unwanted body odor under control while leaving behind a clean and pleasant scent. Its refreshing fragrance makes it an easy addition to your daily personal-care routine, whether you''re heading to work, school, the gym, or out for the day.',NULL,'1 pc',385,NULL,'/media/optimized/agaseke-alo-deodorant.webp',false,3,'cmvv8p4ka0000tq9wg6zkjl7q',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pb4w003ntq9wlzh3tgoi','amara-woven-tote','Amara Woven Tote',NULL,'amara woven tote ','Meet the Amara Woven Tote, a sophisticated statement bag designed to elevate everyday dressing. Its intricate woven texture and warm cognac-brown finish create a luxurious, handcrafted look, while the structured silhouette keeps the design polished and timeless.',NULL,'1 pc',2308,NULL,'/media/optimized/agaseke-amara-woven-tote.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p4lu0004tq9wnlvpwp09',NULL),
  ('cmvv8p8zz001ftq9wjr3fdxnn','aqua-algicule-5l','Aqua Algicule 5l',NULL,'aqua algicule 5l ','Keep your water crystal clear with Aqua Algicule 5l.This high-performance formula effectively prevents and eliminates algae growth, ensuring a clean and safe environment. Ideal for regular maintenance and heavy-duty water treatment.• Size: 5 Liters• Usage Instructions: Shake well before use. Apply the recommended dosage directly to the water system or pool filtration area.• Care & Storage: Store in a cool, dry place away from direct sunlight. Keep out of reach of children.• Delivery: Fast home delivery available across Kigali, or convenient pickup at our shop location.',NULL,'1 pc',885,1154,'/media/optimized/agaseke-aqua-algicule-5l.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p52b0009tq9wu2t9hak0',NULL),
  ('cmvv8p7xh000ttq9wal3hohvz','aqua-anti-stain-5l','Aqua anti-stain 5l',NULL,'aqua anti-stain 5l ','Aqua Anti-Stain 5L is a premium, heavy-duty solution specifically formulated to clean, protect, and restore swimming pool walls. It effectively targets and eliminates stubborn waterline stains, scale deposits, and organic buildup, keeping your pool surface pristine and inviting.Key Benefits• Removes Stubborn Stains: Easily lifts tough algae stains, mineral scaling, and oils along the pool waterline.• Long-Lasting Protection: Helps prevent future discoloration and staining on concrete, tile, and vinyl liners.• Concentrated Formula: The 5-liter volume offers maximum coverage and excellent value for both residential and commercial pools.Application & Care1. Apply the solution directly to stained wall surfaces or mix as directed for general maintenance.2. Scrub gently with a pool brush on stubborn areas.3. Rinse thoroughly.Delivery Notes• Fast home delivery available across Rwanda.• Securely packaged to ensure safe and leak-free transport.',NULL,'1 pc',1154,1385,'/media/optimized/agaseke-aqua-anti-stain-5l.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p52b0009tq9wu2t9hak0',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pc360047tq9wfutdxulf','aqua-chlorine-65-5kg','Aqua chlorine 65% 5kg',NULL,'aqua chlorine 65% 5kg ','Product DescriptionKeep your swimming pool crystal clear and safe with our Premium Aqua Chlorine 65% (5kg). This highly concentrated, stabilized chlorine formula is designed to efficiently eliminate bacteria, algae, and other organic contaminants, ensuring a pristine swimming environment for you and your family.✨ Key Features• High Potency: Features a 65% available chlorine concentration for powerful and long-lasting sanitation.• UV Stabilized: Built-in sun protection prevents chlorine degradation caused by sunlight, making it highly cost-effective.• Algae Control: Actively destroys and prevents the growth of stubborn green, black, and mustard algae.• Slow-Dissolving: Delivers a steady, continuous release of chlorine to maintain optimal sanitization levels over time.🌊 Care & Application Instructions• Testing: Always test your pool water''s pH and chlorine levels before application. Maintain a pH level between 7.2 and 7.6.• Dosage: Refer to your pool size guidelines. Typically added via a floating dispenser, skimmer basket, or an automatic feeder.• Safety Note: Never mix directly with other chemicals. Add this product directly to the pool water or distribution equipment as directed.',NULL,'1 pc',2500,2885,'/media/optimized/agaseke-aqua-chlorine-65-5kg.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p52b0009tq9wu2t9hak0',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pd2c005ftq9w1gk26te6','aqua-chlorine-90-5kg','Aqua chlorine 90% 5kg',NULL,'aqua chlorine 90% 5kg ','Product DescriptionKeep your swimming pool crystal clear and safe with our Premium Aqua Chlorine 90% (5kg). This highly concentrated, stabilized chlorine formula is designed to efficiently eliminate bacteria, algae, and other organic contaminants, ensuring a pristine swimming environment for you and your family.✨ Key Features• High Potency: Features a 90% available chlorine concentration for powerful and long-lasting sanitation.• UV Stabilized: Built-in sun protection prevents chlorine degradation caused by sunlight, making it highly cost-effective.• Algae Control: Actively destroys and prevents the growth of stubborn green, black, and mustard algae.• Slow-Dissolving: Delivers a steady, continuous release of chlorine to maintain optimal sanitization levels over time.🌊 Care & Application Instructions• Testing: Always test your pool water''s pH and chlorine levels before application. Maintain a pH level between 7.2 and 7.6.• Dosage: Refer to your pool size guidelines. Typically added via a floating dispenser, skimmer basket, or an automatic feeder.• Safety Note: Never mix directly with other chemicals. Add this product directly to the pool water or distribution equipment as directed.',NULL,'1 pc',2885,3077,'/media/optimized/agaseke-aqua-chlorine-90-5kg.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p52b0009tq9wu2t9hak0',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pcxb004rtq9wvu1frvx9','aqua-floculant-powder-5kg','Aqua floculant powder 5kg',NULL,'aqua floculant powder 5kg ','Clear & Sparkling Water SolutionRestore and maintain crystal-clear water with our high-grade Aqua Flocculant Powder. Specially formulated to bind microscopic particles together, it makes it easy for your filtration system or manual vacuuming to remove cloudiness fast.Key Benefits & Features:• Rapid Clarification: Efficiently clusters suspended dirt, algae debris, and unfilterable cloudiness into larger clumps that sink to the bottom.• Heavy-Duty Size: The 5kg commercial-grade bucket ensures long-lasting treatment for multiple cleanings.• Versatile Application: Highly effective for large swimming pools, water treatment systems, fountains, and industrial water storage tanks.• Fast-Acting Formula: Watch your water transform from dull and cloudy to sparkling blue in just a matter of hours.How to Use:1. Pre-dissolve the required dose in a bucket of clean water.2. Distribute the dissolved mixture evenly around the perimeter of the water body.3. Run your pump/filtration system for 1–2 hours to thoroughly circulate.4. Turn off the system and let the particles settle to the bottom overnight.5. Vacuum the settled waste directly to waste (drain) the next morning.Delivery & Pickup Info:Available for swift home delivery across Rwanda via local courier or convenient pickup from our shop location in Kigali.',NULL,'1 pc',923,1154,'/media/optimized/agaseke-aqua-floculant-powder-5kg.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p52b0009tq9wu2t9hak0',NULL),
  ('cmvv8pdbd005ptq9wbdbzoxc6','aqua-ph-minus-5l','Aqua ph minus 5l',NULL,'aqua ph minus 5l ','I deal in reducing ph of water to the range between 7 to 7.6 and it comes in 5l',NULL,'1 pc',923,1154,'/media/optimized/agaseke-aqua-ph-minus-5l.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p52b0009tq9wu2t9hak0',NULL),
  ('cmvv8p9nh001xtq9whwlu3znr','aqua-ph-plus-5kg','Aqua ph plus 5kg',NULL,'aqua ph plus 5kg ','Aqua pH Plus 5kg | Swimming Pool pH BalancerMaintain optimal water balance with Aqua pH Plus. Acidic water (pH below 7.2) can damage pool liners, corrode mechanical components, and cause swimmer discomfort. This 5kg treatment efficiently restores your pool to the ideal 7.2–7.6 pH range.Product Features:• Rapid-dissolving formula with no cloudy residue.• Enhances chlorine effectiveness.• Packed in a convenient, heavy-duty 5kg container for easy storage.Note: Always test your pool water before application. Distribute evenly around the deep end of the pool with the filtration system running.',NULL,'1 pc',885,1154,'/media/optimized/agaseke-aqua-ph-plus-5kg.webp',false,1,'cmvv8p52b0009tq9wu2t9hak0',NULL),
